  "name": "Alaska Fisheries Science Center (AFSC) Publications Database",
  "description": "Publications database provides bibliography. Encompasses publications from all AFSC divisions: ABL; NMML; OCD; RACE; and REFM, from 1971 to present. Contains over 4,000 citations for publications authored by Center scientists. Both Simple and Advanced Searches query all citation entries in the database for search terms (e.g, author's last name, common and scientific names, or key words in title). Search results provide complete citation details and links to available on-line publications. Document type include: abstract, AFSC Processed Report, book, book chapter, book review, circulars, journal article, letter to editor, NOAA Technical Memorandum, proceedings, quarterly feature article, and other.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To make AFSC center publications accessible through the Internet.",
